     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking about an alternative",
     "texto": [
      "If a departure is delayed, ask **Når går neste buss?** («When does the next bus leave?») or **Finnes det en annen rute?** («Is there another route?»). Explain your destination and a deadline: **Jeg må være på kurset før klokka to**.",
      "**Kan** lets you ask about possibilities: **Kan jeg ta toget via Arna?**. Confirm which ticket or connection works; a delay notice alone does not guarantee compensation or access to another service."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
